 368:../../../../..//Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \brief   Reverse bit order of value
 369:../../../../..//Drivers/CMSIS/Include/cmsis_gcc.h ****   \details Reverses the bit order of the given value.
